# API Contracts

Never invent endpoint schemas or identifiers.

Before changing API integration:
1. inspect the current contract;
2. distinguish documented evidence from live evidence;
3. preserve backward compatibility where possible;
4. add tests or probes appropriate to the changed contract;
5. explicitly record unresolved fields as REVIEW_REQUIRED.
